      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on CacheBuilder.removalListener and CacheBuilder.build in LevelAttached.<init>(Function, Consumer) (a token handed from the first to the second through a thread-local paired with the CacheBuilder): Flywheel's removal listener runs behind one that releases the value's pin and ignores COLLECTED entries; the builder gets weakKeys().weakValues(); Flywheel's loader runs behind one that pins each loaded value on its key (an Object[] field LevelAttachedPinsMixin adds to Level; a strong side table for keys that are not a Level). Values live exactly as long as their key is reachable from outside the cache; helper bons.furious.patch.flywheel_level_attached.AttachedPins (runtime flag flywheelLevelAttachedWeakKeys, shadow check of lost values). Fix: Create contraption render levels and the ClientLevel behind them leaked through Flywheel's visualization managers.",
      "license": "MIT (Flywheel 1.0.5): no Flywheel code is carried; the mixin wraps two builder calls in LevelAttached's constructor and hands Flywheel's own listener and loader on (helper bons.furious.patch.flywheel_level_attached.AttachedPins)",
